{"speciesId":564,"names":{"fr":"Carapagos","es":"Tirtouga","en":"Tirtouga","ja":"プロトーガ"},"descriptions":[{"language":"fr","version":"black","text":"Il a été recréé à partir d’un fossile préhistorique. Il peut plonger jusqu’à 1 000 mètres de profondeur."},{"language":"en","version":"black","text":"Restored from a fossil, this Pokémon can dive to depths beyond half a mile."},{"language":"fr","version":"white","text":"Il nageait dans les océans il y a 100 millions d’années. Il lui arrive de rallier la terre ferme pour attaquer ses proies."},{"language":"en","version":"white","text":"About 100 million years ago, these Pokémon swam in oceans. It is thought they also went on land to attack prey."},{"language":"en","version":"black-2","text":"This Pokémon was restored from a fossil. It swam skillfully and dove to depths beyond half a mile."},{"language":"en","version":"white-2","text":"This Pokémon was restored from a fossil. It swam skillfully and dove to depths beyond half a mile."},{"language":"fr","version":"x","text":"Il nageait dans les océans il y a 100 millions d’années. Il lui arrive de rallier la terre ferme pour attaquer ses proies."},{"language":"es","version":"x","text":"Ya pululaba por las aguas hace 100 millones de años. También va a tierra a veces en busca de alimento."},{"language":"en","version":"x","text":"About 100 million years ago, these Pokémon swam in oceans. It is thought they also went on land to attack prey."},{"language":"ja","version":"x","text":"およそ １億年前の 海を 泳いでいた。陸地へ 上がって 獲物に 襲いかかる こともある。"},{"language":"fr","version":"y","text":"Il a été recréé à partir d’un fossile préhistorique. Il peut plonger jusqu’à 1 000 mètres de profondeur."},{"language":"es","version":"y","text":"Ha renacido de un fósil prehistórico. Puede sumergirse hasta 1000 m de profundidad."},{"language":"en","version":"y","text":"Restored from a fossil, this Pokémon can dive to depths beyond half a mile."},{"language":"ja","version":"y","text":"古代の 化石から 復活した。 深さ １０００メートルまで 潜水することが できる。"},{"language":"fr","version":"omega-ruby","text":"Il nageait dans les océans il y a 100 millions d’années. Il lui arrive de rallier la terre ferme pour attaquer ses proies."},{"language":"es","version":"omega-ruby","text":"Ya pululaba por las aguas hace 100 millones de años. También va a tierra a veces en busca de alimento."},{"language":"en","version":"omega-ruby","text":"About 100 million years ago, these Pokémon swam in oceans. It is thought they also went on land to attack prey."},{"language":"ja","version":"omega-ruby","text":"およそ １億年前の 海を 泳いでいた。陸地へ 上がって 獲物に 襲いかかる こともある。"},{"language":"fr","version":"alpha-sapphire","text":"Il a été recréé à partir d’un fossile préhistorique. Il peut plonger jusqu’à 1 000 mètres de profondeur."},{"language":"es","version":"alpha-sapphire","text":"Ha renacido de un fósil prehistórico. Puede sumergirse hasta 1000 m de profundidad."},{"language":"en","version":"alpha-sapphire","text":"Restored from a fossil, this Pokémon can dive to depths beyond half a mile."},{"language":"ja","version":"alpha-sapphire","text":"古代の 化石から 復活した。 深さ １０００メートルまで 潜水することが できる。"},{"language":"fr","version":"sun","text":"L’étude de sa structure squelettique suggère qu’il était autrefois capable de plonger jusqu’à 1 000 m de profondeur."},{"language":"es","version":"sun","text":"A juzgar por su estructura ósea, se calcula que podía sumergirse hasta 1 km de profundidad."},{"language":"en","version":"sun","text":"Based on studies of its skeletal structure, it can apparently dive to ocean depths of over half a mile."},{"language":"ja","version":"sun","text":"骨格を 調べる限り およそ １０００メートルの 深海まで 潜っていくことが できたようだ。"},{"language":"fr","version":"moon","text":"Ancêtre présumé de nombreuses espèces de Pokémon tortues, il peuplait les mers chaudes du monde il y a environ 100 millions d’années."},{"language":"es","version":"moon","text":"Se dice que es el predecesor de numerosos Pokémon tortuga. Hace unos 100 millones de años ya habitaba mares templados."},{"language":"en","version":"moon","text":"Reputed to be the ancestor of most turtle Pokémon, it lived in warm seas approximately a hundred million years ago."},{"language":"ja","version":"moon","text":"多くの かめポケモンの 先祖と いわれる。 約１億年前の 温かい 海に 棲んでいた。"},{"language":"fr","version":"ultra-sun","text":"Il a été recréé à partir d’un fossile préhistorique. Il vivait autrefois dans la mer, mais avait su s’adapter pour chasser aussi sur la terre ferme."},{"language":"es","version":"ultra-sun","text":"Se ha logrado reconstruir a partir de fósiles. Aunque viviera en el mar, no dudaba en salir del agua a tierra firme en busca de presas."},{"language":"en","version":"ultra-sun","text":"It was restored from an ancient fossil. Tirtouga lived in the sea but came up onto the land to search for prey."},{"language":"ja","version":"ultra-sun","text":"古代の 化石から 復活。 海に 暮らしていたが 獲物を 探して 陸にも あがっていた。"},{"language":"fr","version":"ultra-moon","text":"Son terrain de chasse s’étendait sur un très vaste territoire, de la terre ferme jusqu’à 1 000 m sous les mers."},{"language":"es","version":"ultra-moon","text":"Poseía un vasto territorio de caza, que abarcaba desde la tierra firme hasta una profundidad marina de 1 km."},{"language":"en","version":"ultra-moon","text":"Its hunting grounds encompassed a broad area, from the land to more than half a mile deep in the ocean."},{"language":"ja","version":"ultra-moon","text":"深さ １０００メートルの 深海から 陸地まで 広い 範囲を 狩場に していた。"},{"language":"fr","version":"sword","text":"Il vivait dans la mer pendant l’ère préhistorique. Il lui arrive de s’aventurer sur la terre ferme pour chasser, bien qu’il ne puisse que ramper."},{"language":"es","version":"sword","text":"Vivía en los mares de hace millones de años. Sale a tierra para buscar presas, aunque solo se pueda desplazar reptando."},{"language":"en","version":"sword","text":"This Pokémon inhabited ancient seas. Although it can only crawl, it still comes up onto land in search of prey."},{"language":"ja","version":"sword","text":"古代の 海に 棲んでいた。 這いずることしか できないが 獲物のために 陸にも 上がる。"},{"language":"fr","version":"shield","text":"Ancêtre présumé de nombreuses espèces de Pokémon tortues, il a été restauré à partir d’un fossile."},{"language":"es","version":"shield","text":"Se piensa que es el antepasado de numerosos Pokémon tortuga. Fue regenerado a partir de un fósil."},{"language":"en","version":"shield","text":"Tirtouga is considered to be the ancestor of many turtle Pokémon. It was restored to life from a fossil."},{"language":"ja","version":"shield","text":"多くの かめポケモンの 先祖と 考えられている ポケモン。 化石から 復元された。"}],"varieties":[{"id":564,"moves":[{"name":"slam","learns":[[11,"egg",0],[14,"egg",0],[15,"egg",0],[16,"egg",0],[17,"egg",0],[18,"egg",0],[20,"egg",0]]},{"name":"body-slam","learns":[[11,"egg",0],[14,"egg",0],[15,"egg",0],[16,"egg",0],[17,"egg",0],[18,"egg",0],[20,"machine",0]]},{"name":"bite","learns":[[11,"level-up",8],[14,"level-up",8],[15,"level-up",8],[16,"level-up",8],[17,"level-up",8],[18,"level-up",8],[20,"level-up",15]]},{"name":"water-gun","learns":[[11,"level-up",1],[14,"level-up",1],[15,"level-up",1],[16,"level-up",1],[17,"level-up",1],[18,"level-up",1],[20,"level-up",1]]},{"name":"hydro-pump","learns":[[11,"level-up",51],[14,"level-up",51],[15,"level-up",50],[16,"level-up",50],[17,"level-up",50],[18,"level-up",50],[20,"level-up",42],[20,"machine",0]]},{"name":"surf","learns":[[11,"machine",0],[14,"machine",0],[15,"machine",0],[16,"machine",0],[17,"machine",0],[18,"machine",0],[20,"machine",0]]},{"name":"ice-beam","learns":[[11,"machine",0],[14,"machine",0],[15,"machine",0],[16,"machine",0],[17,"machine",0],[18,"machine",0],[20,"machine",0]]},{"name":"blizzard","learns":[[11,"machine",0],[14,"machine",0],[15,"machine",0],[16,"machine",0],[17,"machine",0],[18,"machine",0],[20,"machine",0]]},{"name":"strength","learns":[[11,"machine",0],[14,"machine",0],[15,"machine",0],[16,"machine",0]]},{"name":"rock-throw","learns":[[11,"egg",0],[14,"egg",0],[15,"egg",0],[16,"egg",0],[17,"egg",0],[18,"egg",0],[20,